<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Analysis of VAE adaptation strategies. We measure both the mask reconstruction quality (Recon.) and the resulting performance (Perf.) on the MeViS <math id="S4.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="valid_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">valid_{u}</annotation></semantics></math> set with a fixed flow model. VAE is tuned on MeViS training set.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">VAE Adaptation Strategy</th>
<th id="S4.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Recon. <math id="S4.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}\&amp;\mathcal{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">&amp;</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}\&amp;\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="S4.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Perf. <math id="S4.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}\&amp;\mathcal{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">&amp;</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}\&amp;\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Frozen VAE</td>
<td id="S4.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">29.7</td>
<td id="S4.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">19.6</td></tr>
