<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Hyperparameters Settings</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All our models are trained using the AdamW optimizer. We detail the key hyperparameters for our main experiments on Ref-YouTube-VOS and MeViS in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Hyperparameters Settings ‣ Deforming Videos to Masks: Flow Matching for Referring Video Segmentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Key hyperparameters for the training of FlowRVS. We detail the settings for the 2D pre-training, the main DiT fine-tuning on video datasets, and the separate VAE decoder adaptation.</figcaption>
